<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Reset Your Password</title>
    <style>
        body { 
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; 
            background-color: #fafbfc; 
            padding: 50px 20px; 
            margin: 0;
            color: #1a1a1a;
        }
        .card { 
            background: #ffffff; 
            padding: 40px; 
            border-radius: 24px; 
            max-width: 540px; 
            width: 100%;
            margin: 0 auto; 
            box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
            text-align: center;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        .icon-container {
            width: 64px;
            height: 64px;
            background-color: #f0f7f6;
            border-radius: 12px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 0 auto 28px auto;
        }
        .icon-svg {
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            stroke: #00665c;
            fill: none;
        }
        h2 {
            color: #0d1b1e;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-top: 0;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }
        p {
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #4a5558;
            margin-top: 0;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        .btn-container {
            margin: 32px 0 24px 0;
        }
        .btn { 
            display: block; 
            padding: 14px 24px; 
            background-color: #00665c; 
            color: #ffffff !important; 
            text-decoration: none; 
            border-radius: 100px; 
            font-weight: 600; 
            font-size: 15px;
        }
        .footer { 
            margin-top: 40px; 
            padding-top: 24px;
            border-top: 1px solid #f0f2f3;
            font-size: 12px; 
            color: #9aa5a8; 
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="card">
        <div class="icon-container">
            <!-- Lock Icon -->
            <svg class="icon-svg" xmlns="http://w3.org" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M16.5 10.5V6.75a4.5 4.5 0 1 0-9 0v3.75m-.75 11.25h10.5a2.25 2.25 0 0 0 2.25-2.25v-6.75a2.25 2.25 0 0 0-2.25-2.25H6.75a2.25 2.25 0 0 0-2.25 2.25v6.75a2.25 2.25 0 0 0 2.25 2.25Z" />
            </svg>
        </div>
        
        <h2>Reset your password</h2>
        <p>We received a request to reset the password for your EchoStream account. Click the link below to set a new password. This link expires in 15 minutes.</p>
        
        <div class="btn-container">
            <a href="<%= resetLink %>" class="btn">Reset Password</a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="footer">
            If you did not request a password change, you can safely ignore this email. Your password will remain unchanged.<br>
            &copy; 2026 EchoStream. All rights reserved.
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
